# Temporal Tribulation needs exactly two target permanents you control (CR 601.2c): it asks for one target and then a second,
# both at once, and Bot2's Grizzly Bears is not a legal target (CR 115.1, 109.5). The two Moxen are exiled together and come
# back at the beginning of the next end step, as new objects, untapped (CR 603.7c, 400.7). On turn 5 the card is flashed back
# from the graveyard for {5}{U} - the pool empty right after - exiles the same two Moxen again, and exiles itself (CR 702.34a).

